# Fastener-cache provenance breadcrumbs written by
# hexapod_walker/prototype/make_fastener_meshes.py (one line per
# cached STL recording which source -- STEP / user STL / openscad /
# parametric -- produced the mesh).  Regenerated on every
# `make regen-fasteners`; not source.
**/fasteners/*.cache.source.txt

# CAD validation-workflow outputs (rebuild via
# `make -C hexapod_walker/prototype check-cad`).  Contains cad_report.md
# plus per-part PNG renders under views/.
hexapod_walker/prototype/artifacts/

